WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.112
Welcome to Reliance.

00:00:02.132 --> 00:00:08.779
In this walkthrough, we will browse vendor services and compare the trust signals that help you choose with confidence.

00:00:08.799 --> 00:00:18.619
Use search to compare services offered, provider details, customer reviews, public service videos, and Trust Score context before contacting a provider.

00:00:18.639 --> 00:00:24.195
Nearby results only appear when Reliance has a real location or saved address to use.

00:00:24.215 --> 00:00:28.754
If there is no location, Reliance should not pretend something is nearby.

00:00:28.774 --> 00:00:32.774
Some providers may already have public service video evidence.

00:00:32.794 --> 00:00:35.837
Others may still be building trust signals.

00:00:35.857 --> 00:00:42.663
Service offered cards show what the provider can do, while proof-backed cards show completed work customers can review.

00:00:42.683 --> 00:00:46.727
Use all of these signals together before choosing who to contact.
